return {h=5,w=280,cr=190,hc=20,bh=70,gr="medium",eg={"ground"},st={40,80,35,35,45,70},ab={{72,0},{83,0},{128,1}},genus={en="Pig Monkey Pokémon",es="Pokémon Mono Cerdo",pt="Pokémon Macaco-porco"},flavor={en={[1]="Extremely quick to anger. It could be docile one moment then thrashing away the next instant.",[2]="Extremely quick to anger. It could be docile one moment then thrashing away the next instant.",[3]="An agile Pokémon that lives in trees. It angers easily and will not hesitate to attack anything.",[4]="It is extremely ill-tempered. Groups of them will attack any handy target for no reason.",[5]="It's unsafe to approach if it gets violently enraged for no reason and can't distinguish friends from foes.",[6]="It lives in groups in the treetops. If it loses sight of its group, it becomes infuriated by its loneliness.",[7]="When MANKEY starts shaking and its nasal breathing turns rough, it’s a sure sign that it is becoming angry. However, because it goes into a towering rage almost instantly, it is impossible for anyone to flee its wrath.",[8]="When MANKEY starts shaking and its nasal breathing turns rough, it’s a sure sign that it is becoming angry. However, because it goes into a towering rage almost instantly, it is impossible for anyone to flee its wrath.",[9]="When it starts shaking and its nasal breathing turns rough, it’s a sure sign of anger. However, since this happens instantly, there is no time to flee.",[10]="Light and agile on its feet, and ferocious in temperament. When angered, it flies into an uncontrollable frenzy.",[11]="Extremely quick to anger. It could be docile one moment, then thrashing away the next instant.",[12]="It lives in treetop colonies. If one becomes enraged, the whole colony rampages for no reason.",[13]="It lives in treetop colonies. If one becomes enraged, the whole colony rampages for no reason.",[14]="It lives in treetop colonies. If one becomes enraged, the whole colony rampages for no reason.",[15]="It is extremely ill-tempered. Groups of them will attack any handy target for no reason.",[16]="It’s unsafe to approach if it gets violently enraged for no reason and can’t distinguish friends from foes.",[17]="It lives in treetop colonies. If one becomes enraged, the whole colony rampages for no reason.",[18]="It lives in treetop colonies. If one becomes enraged, the whole colony rampages for no reason.",[21]="It lives in treetop colonies. If one becomes enraged, the whole colony rampages for no reason.",[22]="It lives in treetop colonies. If one becomes enraged, the whole colony rampages for no reason.",[23]="It’s unsafe to approach if it gets violently enraged for no reason and can’t distinguish friends from foes.",[24]="It lives in treetop colonies. If one becomes enraged, the whole colony rampages for no reason.",[25]="When Mankey starts shaking and its nasal breathing turns rough, it’s a sure sign that it is becoming angry. However, because it goes into a towering rage almost instantly, it is impossible for anyone to flee its wrath.",[26]="When Mankey starts shaking and its nasal breathing turns rough, it’s a sure sign that it is becoming angry. However, because it goes into a towering rage almost instantly, it is impossible for anyone to flee its wrath.",[27]="It can spontaneously become enraged. Everyone near it clears out as it rampages, and the resulting loneliness makes it angrier still.",[28]="Its raging tires it out and causes it to fall asleep, but the anger resonating in its dreams causes it to wake up, which infuriates it all over again.",[29]="The smallest of things could cause it to lose its temper. Because it doesn’t hold in its stress, this Pokémon can live a long time.",[30]="If one gets angry, all the others around it will get angry, so silence is a rare visitor in a troop of Mankey.",[31]="An agile Pokémon that lives in trees. It angers easily and will not hesitate to attack anything.",[32]="An agile Pokémon that lives in trees. It angers easily and will not hesitate to attack anything."},es={[23]="Es peligroso acercarse si se enfada sin razón aparente, ya que no distingue entre amigos y enemigos.",[24]="Vive en colonias en los árboles. Si uno se enfada, el resto de la manada ataca sin motivo.",[25]="Cuando Mankey empieza a temblar y a respirar con más intensidad, seguro que va a enfadarse. Aunque prever su enfado no sirve de nada porque alcanza un estado de rabia tan rápido que no hay escapatoria.",[26]="Cuando Mankey empieza a temblar y a respirar con más intensidad, seguro que va a enfadarse. Aunque prever su enfado no sirve de nada porque alcanza un estado de rabia tan rápido que no hay escapatoria.",[27]="Se enfada sin razón aparente. Cuando todos lo dejan solo para no tener que lidiar con su ira, Mankey se enoja más aún.",[28]="Tras desatar su ira, le entra sueño y se duerme. Sin embargo, sus pesadillas lo atormentan aún más, por lo que se despierta de muy mal humor.",[29]="Se encoleriza enseguida por cualquier minucia. Por otro lado, al no acumular estrés, suele gozar de una vida longeva.",[30]="Cuando un ejemplar se enfada, contagia su ira al resto, por lo que los grupos de Mankey desconocen el concepto de vida reposada.",[31]="Este ágil Pokémon vive en los árboles. Se enfada con facilidad y, cuando lo hace, se abalanza contra todo lo que se encuentre a su alrededor.",[32]="Este ágil Pokémon vive en los árboles. Se enfada con facilidad y, cuando lo hace, se abalanza contra todo lo que se encuentre a su alrededor."},pt="Um Pokémon ágil que vive em árvores. Irrita-se com facilidade e não hesita em atacar qualquer coisa."},evo={{s=56},{s=57,from=56,c={{t="level-up",lv=28}}},{s=979,from=57,c={{t="use-move",used_move=889,move_count=20}}}},moves={[1]={1,10,1,43,15,2,21,154,27,116,33,69,39,37},[2]={1,10,1,43,9,67,15,2,21,154,27,116,33,69,39,37,45,103},[3]={1,10,1,43,9,67,15,2,21,154,27,116,33,69,39,238,45,103,51,37},[4]={1,10,1,43,9,67,15,2,21,154,27,116,33,69,39,238,45,103,51,37},[5]={1,10,1,43,9,67,15,2,21,154,27,116,33,69,3